            "title": "日本8月核心消費物價按年升1.7%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日本八月核心消費物價按年上升百分之一點七，連續第八個月維持在百分之二以下。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">總務省表示，撇除波動較大的新鮮食品後，全國消費物價指數升幅較七月的百分之一點八為慢，主要由於能源價格回落。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499785_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499785_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499785_04.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499785_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499785_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/0